          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ONE SAMPLER RUN TO FIX UP i2i IMAGES:\n\ndisable the resize by long edge\ndisable the second KSampler\ndisable the upscale by latent\nset your remaining KSampler to 0.1 to start\n\nI currently like Heun/beta or er_sde/simple for this on skin but it can damage clothing (at 4mp) but very low denoise else it blows out (try down at 0.03 and step up by 0.01 increments until you hit the sweet spot). They are all okay if you get the right balance and all blow out if you dont, seems to be model related and very common in the turbo model for a lot of people. I need to test further.\n\nincreasing steps can help (from 9 to 12) and aura flow (start at 3 but testm 6 to 7 if you want stronger effect). but dappling is still there at 0.1 denoise with clothing. I then usually reduce the denoise to below 0.1 (down to 0.03) to mitigate it.\n\nDENOISE:\n\n- light fix without losing consistency: 0.1 or less (even try 0.05)\n\n- 0.2 to deplastic a face without losing consistency. (e.g. Klein swap inpaint outputs) \n\n- with er_sde / simple but reduce denoise (to 0.1 or 0.2) for that else it will dapple skin too harshly.\n\n- good improvements but it will change faces 0.3 or more (er_sde / simple will effect it a lot more than dpmpp+sde/karras)\n\nSETTINGS I TRIED GOOD FOR SKIN FIX:\n\n- er_sde / simple, denoise 0.1 (prone to dappling but realism is there)\n\n- heun / beta, denoise 0.1 (better quality than er_sde slight dappling still but more realistic, takes a bit longer. however 0.2 destroyed the skin with freckles like skin disease but I think this is the model or something as it happens with heun too\n\n- (dppmpp+sde / Karras is good for t2i but I dont find it very good for i2i and doesnt do much even at denoise 0.4)\n\n- euler_ancestal / beta, denoise 0.1 (maybe better if went higher denoise but think it will introduce dappling but untested)\n\n- res_2s / bong tangent (needs RES4LYF installed) (did nothing at denoise 0.1, while 0.4 destroyed the skin with freckles like skin disease but I think this is the model or something as it happens with heun too at even lower denoise)\n\n- dpmpp_2m_sde with linear_quadratic (may want to add 2 extra steps) made no difference, even at 0.1 it could cause dappling.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# ONE SAMPLER RUN TO FIX UP i2i IMAGES:\n\ndisable the resize by long edge\ndisable the second KSampler\ndisable the upscale by latent\nset your remaining KSampler to 0.1 to start\n\nI currently like Heun/beta or er_sde/simple for this on skin but it can damage clothing (at 4mp) but very low denoise else it blows out (try down at 0.03 and step up by 0.01 increments until you hit the sweet spot). They are all okay if you get the right balance and all blow out if you dont, seems to be model related and very common in the turbo model for a lot of people. I need to test further.\n\nincreasing steps can help (from 9 to 12) and aura flow (start at 3 but testm 6 to 7 if you want stronger effect). but dappling is still there at 0.1 denoise with clothing. I then usually reduce the denoise to below 0.1 (down to 0.03) to mitigate it.\n\nDENOISE:\n\n- light fix without losing consistency: 0.1 or less (even try 0.05)\n\n- 0.2 to deplastic a face without losing consistency. (e.g. Klein swap inpaint outputs) \n\n- with er_sde / simple but reduce denoise (to 0.1 or 0.2) for that else it will dapple skin too harshly.\n\n- good improvements but it will change faces 0.3 or more (er_sde / simple will effect it a lot more than dpmpp+sde/karras)\n\nSETTINGS I TRIED GOOD FOR SKIN FIX:\n\n- er_sde / simple, denoise 0.1 (prone to dappling but realism is there)\n\n- heun / beta, denoise 0.1 (better quality than er_sde slight dappling still but more realistic, takes a bit longer. however 0.2 destroyed the skin with freckles like skin disease but I think this is the model or something as it happens with heun too\n\n- (dppmpp+sde / Karras is good for t2i but I dont find it very good for i2i and doesnt do much even at denoise 0.4)\n\n- euler_ancestal / beta, denoise 0.1 (maybe better if went higher denoise but think it will introduce dappling but untested)\n\n- res_2s / bong tangent (needs RES4LYF installed) (did nothing at denoise 0.1, while 0.4 destroyed the skin with freckles like skin disease but I think this is the model or something as it happens with heun too at even lower denoise)\n\n- dpmpp_2m_sde with linear_quadratic (may want to add 2 extra steps) made no difference, even at 0.1 it could cause dappling.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
